<title>CHINA: China Jan-June sugar imports slump 35.6 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-June sugar imports slump 35.6 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>China imported 360,000 tonnes of sugar in the first half of this year, down by 35.6 percent from the same 1996 period, customs figures showed on Friday.</p>
<p>	  IMPORTS JAN-JUNE    JUNE	YR/YR PCTAGE CHANGE</p>
<p> Sugar    360,000	    150,000	 -35.6</p>
<p>	  EXPORTS JAN-JUNE    JUNE	YR/YR PCTAGE CHANGE</p>
<p>	    121,736	    29,633	  -68.2</p>
<p>Note: figures in tonnes.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532-1921</p>
</text>
